            "notes": "The main focus of this control deck is to use a combination of powerful counterspells, removal spells, and disruptive creatures to control the game and prevent the opponent from executing their game plan effectively. With Atraxa, Praetors' Voice as the commander, the deck aims to establish board control and outvalue the opponent by using cards like True-Name Nemesis, Teferi, Time Raveler, and Narset, Parter of Veils to limit their options. The deck also includes a variety of card draw spells like Serum Visions and Gitaxian Probe to maintain card advantage and consistently have answers to threats. By utilizing a mix of proactive and reactive spells, this deck aims to dominate the battlefield and secure victory through strategic decision-making and resource management."
